# Vulkan ICD selection, read by /vendor/lib64/hw/vulkan.switcher.so.
#
#   <package>=<subname>   load /vendor/lib64/hw/vulkan.<subname>.so for that app
#   *=<subname>           default for every process without an exact rule
#
# Known subnames:
#   adreno       OEM Qualcomm driver (vulkan.adreno.so), Vulkan 1.3.295
#   freedreno    Mesa Turnip (vulkan.freedreno.so), Vulkan 1.4.x on a7xx
#
# This file is the image default and is read-only at runtime. To change a
# mapping without rebuilding, write the same syntax to
# /data/misc/vulkan/per_app.conf -- it takes priority over this file, and only
# the affected app has to restart (force-stop, then relaunch).
#
# Malformed lines, unknown subnames and packages that match nothing are
# ignored; the driver always falls back to something loadable.

*=freedreno

# Per-app examples, off by default:
# com.tungsten.fcl=adreno       # avoid Turnip shader-compile stalls in some FCL versions
# gpuservice=adreno             # keep `dumpsys gpu` reporting the OEM ICD
